{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09468","headline":"鼙鼓行 · 韦应物","name":"鼙鼓行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮海生云暮惨澹，广陵城头颦鼓暗。\n寒声坎坎风动边，忽似孤城万里绝，四望无人烟。\n又如虏骑截辽水，胡马不食仰朔天。\n座中亦有燕赵士，闻颦不语客心死。\n何况鳏孤火绝无晨炊，独妇夜泣官有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}